      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Monitor"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Monitors act as the primary visual display units delivering softcopy output.",
        "Printers generate hardcopy output and are broadly categorized into Impact and Non-Impact types.",
        "Plotters are specialized line-drawing output devices designed for high-resolution vector graphics and engineering prints.",
        "Speakers convert processed digital signals into audible sound output."
      ],
